    {
      "id": "claim_469bcc1753f840b9915fa067e0d3e19e",
      "statement": "`langgraph dev --debug-port PORT --wait-for-client` enables remote debugging by listening on the specified port for a debugger client (requires debugpy); `langgraph up --debugger-port PORT` launches a LangGraph Debugger container that serves a web UI to inspect runs and graph state.",
